OL,3,GNEWSAThief helped postmistress stage
OL,4,A#52k robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thief who admitted helping a
OL,7,Fpostmistress stage a #52,000 robbery
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for three and a half
OL,9,Fyears, although he walked free from
OL,10,Fcourt due to the amount of time spent
OL,11,Fon remand.
OL,13,FLee Stevens, 39, bound the woman and
OL,14,Ftook money from a safe at a Post Office
OL,15,Fin Newcastle, but messages between the
OL,16,Fpair showed it was "pretend", the
OL,17,Fcity's crown court heard.
OL,19,FThe woman, named in court documents as
OL,20,FDawn Rankin, had denied wrongdoing but
OL,21,Fdied before her trial could take place,
OL,22,Fthe court heard.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
